      "chapter": "Finance",
      "table_no": null,
      "title": "[Levies to be abolished under the Draft Regulations governing the Special Consumption Tax]",
      "caption_extra": "Likin Abolition. Draft Regulations governing the Special Consumption Tax after the abolition of Inland Transit Dues. A. Procedure of Abolishing Transit Dues.",
      "continued": false,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "I. The following levies shall be abolished by the respective Provincial authorities",
          "columns": [
            "No.",
            "Levy"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "1.",
              "Likin."
            ],
            [
              "2.",
              "Commodity taxes of every description derived from Likin."
            ],
            [
              "3.",
              "Principal and miscellaneous internal taxes and contributions having the nature of transit dues."
            ],
            [
              "4.",
              "Octroi."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "II. The following levies shall be abolished periodically by the Ministry of Finance. The first three shall have been abolished completely by the end of November 1928 and the rest by the end of December, 1928.",
          "columns": [
            "No.",
            "Levy"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "1.",
              "Railroad commodity contributions."
            ],
            [
              "2.",
              "Parcel post taxes."
            ],
            [
              "3.",
              "Native customs revenue outside the 50-li limit of the treaty ports."
            ],
            [
              "4.",
              "Transit dues of maritime and land customs houses."
            ],
            [
              "5.",
              "Re-import duty of maritime and land customs houses."
            ],
            [
              "6.",
              "Export duty of the maritime or land customs houses for goods from one port to another."
            ],
            [
              "7.",
              "Native customs revenue within the 50-li limit of the treaty ports."
            ],
            [
              "8.",
              "Surtax of maritime and land customs houses."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [
        "The frontier and coastal native customs houses which levy import or export duties, shall not be included in the list of those to be abolished."
      ],
      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Lists of levies embedded in clauses I and II of section A; the clause text is given as part labels. Clause I also states that all Likin offices shall be abolished or consolidated before the end of September, 1928, and abolished completely before the end of November, 1928."
      ],
      "id": "p1050_1",
      "scans": [
        {
          "label": "scan leaf 1050",
          "url": "https://archive.org/details/china-year-book-1929-30/page/n1050/mode/1up"
        }
      ]
    }
