      "table_no": null,
      "title": "[Kinds of Special Consumption Tax and goods subject to it]",
      "caption_extra": "Likin Abolition. Draft Regulations governing the Special Consumption Tax. C. Kinds of Special Consumption Tax",
      "continued": false,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": "I. Such special consumption tax shall be of three kinds",
          "columns": [
            "No.",
            "Kind of tax"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "1.",
              "Sugar tax."
            ],
            [
              "2.",
              "Textile goods tax."
            ],
            [
              "3.",
              "Output tax—beginning with flour, then with thrown silk, cotton yarn, and wheat tax, cocoon tax and raw cotton tax."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "II. The Provincial Commissions of Finance shall collect the special consumption tax on the following goods",
          "columns": [
            "No.",
            "Goods"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "1.",
              "Coal, etc."
            ],
            [
              "2.",
              "Oil."
            ],
            [
              "3.",
              "Tea."
            ],
            [
              "4.",
              "Paper."
            ],
            [
              "5.",
              "Tinfoil."
            ],
            [
              "6.",
              "Sea-products."
            ],
            [
              "7.",
              "Bamboo and wood."
            ],
            [
              "8.",
              "Chinaware and earthenware."
            ],
            [
              "9.",
              "Silk, satin."
            ],
            [
              "10.",
              "Live stock (pigs, sheep, and cows only)."
            ],
            [
              "11.",
              "Medicine."
            ],
            [
              "12.",
              "Varnish."
            ],
            [
              "13.",
              "Skins, furs, etc. (leather, furs, and feathers)."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [
        "(Continued on next page.)"
      ],
      "transcriber_notes": [
        "The page ends '(Continued on next page.)' after item 13. The next leaf (p1052, p. 683) is the sideways consumption-tax estimate table, and p1053 (p. 684) resumes with prose ('The kinds and amount of consumption tax to be levied on the above articles...'), so the list appears to end at item 13.",
        "Section B (Principles governing the imposition of Special Consumption Tax) on this page is numbered clauses, treated as prose."
      ],
