      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Table printed sideways (rotated); read from a rotated crop.",
        "Fukien figures marked with a dollar sign drawn with a double/barred stroke, distinct from the plain $ in other columns; transcribed as '$'.",
        "Chekiang 'Cocoons & Silk' cell prints two bracketed entries: 'Cocoons 1,100,000' and 'Silk 800,000'; kept in one cell.",
        "Total column prints only Likin ($27,890,000), Total of Special Consumption Tax Receipts (15,990,000) and Deficit (11,900,000); a stray mark in the Total column at the Sugar row is not a figure.",
        "Text on p. 684 refers to this as 'the table on page 679'; printed page number on this leaf is 683.",
        "Likin across provinces: 9,000,000+7,000,000+3,160,000+5,130,000+3,600,000 = 27,890,000 — reconciles with Total $27,890,000.",
        "Total of Special Consumption Tax Receipts, parts (Tea to All Others) vs printed: Kiangsu 3,617,659 vs 3,357,159 (diff 260,500); Chekiang 5,121,000 (counting Cocoons 1,100,000 and Silk 800,000) vs 4,966,000 (diff 155,000); Anhwei 1,200,000 vs 1,160,000 (diff 40,000); Fukien 3,574,248 vs 3,302,549 (diff 271,699); Kiangsi 2,800,000 vs 3,200,000 (diff -400,000) — none reconciles.",
        "Total of Special Consumption Tax Receipts across provinces: 15,985,708 vs printed 15,990,000 — does NOT reconcile (diff -4,292).",
        "Deficit = Likin - Total receipts: Kiangsu 5,642,841 vs printed 5,642,000 (diff -841); Chekiang 2,034,000, Anhwei 2,000,000, Kiangsi 400,000 reconcile; Fukien 1,827,451 vs printed 1,827,400 (diff -51). Deficits across provinces sum to 11,903,400 vs printed 11,900,000 (diff -3,400); 27,890,000 - 15,990,000 = 11,900,000 reconciles.",
        "Check pass C01: re-read every cell of all six figure columns (incl. blanks and row alignment of the Fukien and Kiangsi entries) from fresh rotated crops; no changes. Discrepancies are in the print."
      ],
